      Market Data: Buy at ${opp.buyExchange} ($${opp.buyPrice.toFixed(2)}), Sell at ${opp.sellExchange} ($${opp.sellPrice.toFixed(2)}). 
      Order Book Depth: 
      - Bid Side: ${opp.bidVolume.toFixed(2)} vol (${opp.bidWall.toFixed(0)}% wall strength)
      - Ask Side: ${opp.askVolume.toFixed(2)} vol (${opp.askWall.toFixed(0)}% wall strength)
