      - Liquidity: ${opp.liquidityDepth}

      Analyze for potential 'spoofing' manipulation, wash trading patterns, or low-liquidity slippage traps. 
      Is this arbitrage opportunity safe to execute?`;

      (window as any).triggerNexusAi(prompt);

